# CoreFlow Root Gitignore

# Node.js
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/

# Environment Variables (CRITICAL)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
.gemini/
